{
  "title": "About Artefact UI",
  "content": [
    {
      "blockType": "stack",
      "direction": "vertical",
      "align": "center",
      "gap": "4",
      "children": [
        {
          "blockType": "badge",
          "variant": "subtle",
          "text": "Our story",
          "colorPalette": "purple",
          "size": "lg"
        },
        {
          "blockType": "heading",
          "text": "Building the design system we always wanted",
          "size": "6xl",
          "as": "h1",
          "style": "text-align:center;max-width:44rem"
        },
        {
          "blockType": "text",
          "size": "lg",
          "content": "Artefact UI is a component library and CMS-driven page builder, made by a small team that got tired of rebuilding the same primitives from scratch on every project.",
          "style": "text-align:center;max-width:38rem"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "blockType": "grid",
      "gap": "6",
      "children": [
        {
          "blockType": "card",
          "title": "120+",
          "description": "Components shipped",
          "body": "Accessible, themeable, and documented — from buttons to date pickers.",
          "imagePosition": "top",
          "variant": "elevated"
        },
        {
          "blockType": "card",
          "title": "6",
          "description": "Languages supported",
          "body": "English, Chinese, Spanish, Portuguese, French, and German, out of the box.",
          "imagePosition": "top",
          "variant": "elevated"
        },
        {
          "blockType": "card",
          "title": "2021",
          "description": "Founded",
          "body": "Started as an internal toolkit before we open-sourced it for everyone.",
          "imagePosition": "top",
          "variant": "elevated"
        }
      ],
      "columns": "{\"base\": 1, \"md\": 3}"
    },
    {
      "blockType": "stack",
      "direction": "vertical",
      "gap": "4",
      "backgroundColor": "#f8fafc",
      "padding": "2.5rem 2rem",
      "borderRadius": "1.25rem",
      "margin": "3rem 0",
      "children": [
        {
          "blockType": "heading",
          "text": "Our mission",
          "size": "3xl",
          "as": "h2"
        },
        {
          "blockType": "text",
          "size": "lg",
          "content": "We believe teams move faster when design and engineering share one source of truth. Artefact UI pairs a real component library with a page builder that non-engineers can use safely — so the design system stays the single place changes happen, instead of drifting into one-off overrides."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "blockType": "heading",
      "text": "What we value",
      "size": "3xl",
      "as": "h2"
    },
    {
      "blockType": "grid",
      "gap": "6",
      "children": [
        {
          "blockType": "card",
          "children": [
            {
              "blockType": "badge",
              "text": "Accessible",
              "variant": "subtle",
              "colorPalette": "green"
            }
          ],
          "title": "Accessible by default",
          "description": "Keyboard and screen-reader support ship with every component",
          "body": "We test with real assistive technology, not just automated audits, so accessibility holds up in production.",
          "imagePosition": "top",
          "variant": "elevated"
        },
        {
          "blockType": "card",
          "children": [
            {
              "blockType": "badge",
              "text": "Composable",
              "variant": "subtle",
              "colorPalette": "purple"
            }
          ],
          "title": "Composable, not prescriptive",
          "description": "Small primitives that combine instead of one giant configuration object",
          "body": "Every component is built from the same recipe system, so customizing one doesn't mean fighting the others.",
          "imagePosition": "top",
          "variant": "elevated"
        },
        {
          "blockType": "card",
          "children": [
            {
              "blockType": "badge",
              "text": "Transparent",
              "variant": "subtle"
            }
          ],
          "title": "Open about tradeoffs",
          "description": "Docs explain the why, not just the API",
          "body": "When something is a deliberate tradeoff rather than a bug, we say so — in the docs, not just the changelog.",
          "imagePosition": "top",
          "variant": "elevated"
        }
      ],
      "columns": "{\"base\": 1, \"md\": 3}"
    },
    {
